{"id":"nizhe","lemma":"ниже","pos":"adv","rank":1076,"glosses":["below, beneath, under","lower, down (from a higher to a lower position, downwards)","shorter"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1f/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он был ниже меня.","en":"He was shorter than me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Он ниже своего брата.","en":"He's shorter than his brother.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"brother","l":"брат"}]},{"text":"Моя сестра ниже тебя.","en":"My sister is shorter than you.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"sister"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Том ниже всех своих друзей.","en":"Tom is shorter than all of his friends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655895","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"all","l":"весь"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я ниже его.","en":"I'm shorter than him.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"him / his"}]}]}